# N4 slice 1, staged (LMX_semantics.ru.md #method-parts, #dynamic): the map assumes the layout a place keeps, proved
# only for a place no statement rebinds. D is rebound to E under a flag, so the layout of D at the call is not proved:
# refused at the data operand until rows for layouts known only at run time exist.
int: flag 1
S:
    int: x
    x: x + 1
end: S
D:
    int: x 1
end: D
E:
    int: pad 0
    int: x 2
end: E
if: flag = 1
    D: E
call: S D
return
